+| `lifecycle-isolated-none-2` | 0 | 10000.692 ms | 205942562 |
+| `lifecycle-isolated-unrelated-1` | 0 | 10000.530 ms | 200154960 |
+| `lifecycle-isolated-matching-1` | 40 | 10000.438 ms | 237704818 |
